# rewrite-msgid: /configuration settings/settings/
#: kioskgui.cpp:120
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>Your system contains KDE configuration settings in the skeleton "
"directory <b>%1</b>. These files are copied to the personal KDE settings "
"directory of newly created users.<p>This may interfere with the correct "
"operation of user profiles.<p>Unless a setting has been locked down, "
"settings that have been copied to the personal KDE settings directory of a "
"user will override a default setting configured in a profile.<p><b>If this "
"is not the intended behavior, please remove the offending files from the "
"skeleton folder on all systems that you want to administer with user "
"profiles.</b><p>The following files were found under <b>%2</b>:"
msgstr ""
"<html><p>Vaš sistem sadrži postavke KDE‑a u skeletnoj fascikli <filename>%1</"
"filename>. Pri dodavanju novog korisnika, datoteke se odatle kopiraju u "
"korisnikovu fasciklu ličnih postavki KDE‑a.</p><p>Ovo može dovesti do "
"problema sa ispravnim funkcionisanjem korisničkih profila.</p><p>Osim kada "
"je postavka zaključana, postavke kopirane u korisnikovu ličnu fasciklu "
"postavki KDE‑a pregaziće podrazumijevane postavke podešene u profilu.</"
"p><p><b>Ako ovo ponašanje nije željeno, uklonite pomenute datoteke iz "
"skeletne fascikle na svim sistemima koje želite da administrirate pomoću "
"korisničkih profila.</b></p><p>Sledeći datoteke su nađeni pod <filename>%2</"
"filename>:</p></html>:"

